<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> Few pointers:  [""] is immediate, and compiles a counted 
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> string into the dictionary...when the compiled word is
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> run the address of the string is on the stack
