<D.RUFFER> \         --dave (9/15/88)
<D.RUFFER> : (runtime)     ( word-name-addr -- )
<D.RUFFER>                 ( finds word-name and executes it if it exists, otherwise )
<D.RUFFER>                 ( it aborts with an error message                         )
<D.RUFFER>         ( word ) find if
<D.RUFFER>                 execute
<D.RUFFER>         else
<D.RUFFER>                 ". abort" not found"
<D.RUFFER>         then
<D.RUFFER>         ;
<D.RUFFER> : [runtime]     ( -- )
<D.RUFFER>                 ( input stream: <name> )
<D.RUFFER>                 ( changes the binding of <name> to runtime instead of compile )
<D.RUFFER>                 ( time                                                        )
<D.RUFFER>         [compile] [""]                  \ Compile <name> into the dictionary
<D.RUFFER>         compile (runtime)               \ and add the code to find and
<D.RUFFER>                                         \ execute <name>
<D.RUFFER>         ;
<D.RUFFER>         immediate
